},
{
"n": 28,
"h": "d8c85bd8",
"en_raw": "...What?"
},
{
"n": 29,
"h": "31c35878",
"en_raw": "I'm asking you"
},
{
"n": 30,
"h": "30b13220",
"en_raw": "Are you a Kinkodal child?"
},
{
"n": 31,
"h": "d6736738",
"en_raw": "Huh?"
},
{
"n": 32,
"h": "c432cfda",
"en_raw": "...Hm!?"
},
{
"n": 33,
"h": "8e2d4ff5",
"en_raw": "..............."
},
{
"n": 34,
"h": "bf8e36be",
"en_raw": "My mistake,"
},
{
"n": 35,
"h": "8f64a83c",
"en_raw": "so you're an Earthling after all"
},
{
"n": 36,
"h": "056d1171",
"en_raw": "...Stop it, mister, you're scary"
},
{
"n": 37,
"h": "0ff23085",
"en_raw": "Anyway, I'm busy communicating now"
},
{
"n": 38,
"h": "62e9ab76",
"en_raw": "If you're an Earthling, come again"
},
{
"n": 39,
"h": "b7f9f02e",
"en_raw": ".........."
},
{
"n": 40,
"h": "2efe0361",
"en_raw": "What communication"
},
{
"n": 41,
"h": "290b5a91",
"en_raw": "You're just spacing out"
},
{
"n": 42,
"h": "243fa9cd",
"en_raw": "Mister, sorry"
},
{
"n": 43,
"h": "4e772db9",
"en_raw": "The word \"bath\" seems"
},
{
"n": 44,
"h": "74359961",
"en_raw": "absent from this guy's dictionary"
},
{
"n": 45,
"h": "3c982fb5",
"en_raw": "Hey!"
},
{
"n": 46,
"h": "b7f9f02e",
"en_raw": ".........."
},
{
"n": 47,
"h": "5faa8d72",
"en_raw": "Hey, I said, hey!"
},
{
"n": 48,
"h": "55e6fc3c",
"en_raw": "...Ah, a girl of Earth"
},
{
"n": 49,
"h": "6d4393b8",
"en_raw": "Watching too much TV is bad"
},
{
"n": 50,
"h": "ad158dee",
"en_raw": "Hey, mister, frankly"
},
{
"n": 51,
"h": "08d81604",
"en_raw": "about me,"
},
{
"n": 52,
"h": "139ac70b",
"en_raw": "of us, aren't you?"
},
{
"n": 53,
"h": "552ed289",
"en_raw": "Huh? ...Is that so?"
},
{
"n": 54,
"h": "ec11597e",
"en_raw": "That does it!"
},
{
"n": 55,
"h": "ad3cc7f6",
"en_raw": "I'll find out what words"
},
{
"n": 56,
"h": "3631320a",
"en_raw": "you react to"
},
{
"n": 57,
"h": "97bee8ab",
"en_raw": "Stanislas"
},
{
"n": 58,
"h": "091f1cf8",
"en_raw": "Klossowski"
},
{
"n": 59,
"h": "3ac836a1",
"en_raw": "de Rola"
},
{
"n": 60,
"h": "b7f9f02e",
"en_raw": ".........."
},
{
"n": 61,
"h": "dcf1253f",
"en_raw": "Muddy water"
},
{
"n": 62,
"h": "7467c7ef",
"en_raw": "flowing, clearing: Santoka"
},
{
"n": 63,
"h": "b7f9f02e",
"en_raw": ".........."
},
{
"n": 64,
"h": "9efb32be",
"en_raw": "Today's game business"
},
{
"n": 65,
"h": "991a4659",
"en_raw": "is high risk, high return"
},
{
"n": 66,
"h": "b7f9f02e",
"en_raw": ".........."
},
{
"n": 67,
"h": "2553f2e2",
"en_raw": "Sri Jayawardenepura"
},
{
"n": 68,
"h": "26864119",
"en_raw": "Kotte"
},
{
"n": 69,
"h": "b7f9f02e",
"en_raw": ".........."
},
{
"n": 70,
"h": "ea1d0e76",
"en_raw": "The economy, unemployment"
},
{
"n": 71,
"h": "5966941e",
"en_raw": "the Asian crisis"
},
{
"n": 72,
"h": "30aeefe1",
"en_raw": "the Year 2000 problem"
},
{
"n": 73,
"h": "19a29f91",
"en_raw": "cold pizza"
},
{
"n": 74,
"h": "6b978c3f",
"en_raw": "...Hmm, how unexpected"
},
{
"n": 75,
"h": "1f382e00",
"en_raw": "This Earth girl"
},
{
"n": 76,
"h": "34105b49",
"en_raw": "knows words, doesn't she"
},
{
"n": 77,
"h": "d934f7ff",
"en_raw": "You think I'm cheeky, don't you?"
},
{
"n": 78,
"h": "2c76d186",
"en_raw": "No, it's the TV's fault"
},
{
"n": 79,
"h": "b3b96ff2",
"en_raw": "The TV that ordinary kids watch"
},
{
"n": 80,
"h": "cae95d4b",
"en_raw": "I don't watch"
},
{
"n": 81,
"h": "c6f718e6",
"en_raw": "that stuff"
},
{
"n": 82,
"h": "921c783a",
"en_raw": "Hmm, then..."
},
{
"n": 83,
"h": "3fd979bb",
"en_raw": "Hey, mister?"
},
{
"n": 84,
"h": "8f0f8eae",
"en_raw": "I have a question for you"
},
{
"n": 85,
"h": "06ae8bed",
"en_raw": "You received such words and information"
},
{
"n": 86,
"h": "b49618d5",
"en_raw": "not on someone else's antenna"
},
{
"n": 87,
"h": "74a1db42",
"en_raw": "but on your own antenna,"
},
{
"n": 88,
"h": "8f840d0c",
"en_raw": "is that what you mean?"
},
{
"n": 89,
"h": "456f8f29",
"en_raw": "I'm not bragging or anything"
},
{
"n": 90,
"h": "457207a5",
"en_raw": "I just hated being treated"
},
{
"n": 91,
"h": "98c67080",
"en_raw": "like a trend-follower"
},
{
"n": 92,
"h": "1e2980e9",
"en_raw": "Oho, how rare"
},
{
"n": 93,
"h": "3fd979bb",
"en_raw": "Hey, mister?"
},
{
"n": 94,
"h": "201bf850",
"en_raw": "True wisdom"
},
{
"n": 95,
"h": "70697175",
"en_raw": "is still far off"
},
{
"n": 96,
"h": "2105dce8",
"en_raw": "but you"
},
{
"n": 97,
"h": "68843e88",
"en_raw": "seem to have the potential"
},
{
"n": 98,
"h": "c1b730bf",
"en_raw": "I've reconsidered you, girl of Earth"
},
{
"n": 99,
"h": "624b0125",
"en_raw": "Being reconsidered by a mister..."
},
{
"n": 100,
"h": "982d21b7",
"en_raw": "Hey, mister"
},
{
"n": 101,
"h": "d6e3828c",
"en_raw": "So, girl of Earth"
},
{
"n": 102,
"h": "1b370fe0",
"en_raw": "mister, maybe"
},
{
"n": 103,
"h": "717c5ad9",
"en_raw": "you were actually"
},
{
"n": 104,
"h": "ddf8c043",
"en_raw": "really smart?"
},
{
"n": 105,
"h": "0949efb1",
"en_raw": "Huh?"
},
{
"n": 106,
"h": "4389e3a7",
"en_raw": "Why would you say that?"
},
{
"n": 107,
"h": "2dc9dd95",
"en_raw": "Just a feeling"
},
{
"n": 108,
"h": "b910ed92",
"en_raw": "...You mentioned something"
},
{
"n": 109,
"h": "a9ae5bde",
"en_raw": "about a TV station before, right?"
},
{
"n": 110,
"h": "810cf13d",
"en_raw": "I thought maybe"
},
{
"n": 111,
"h": "c5a835a3",
"en_raw": "you were some"
},
{
"n": 112,
"h": "cbdcc219",
"en_raw": "great elite or something"
},
{
"n": 113,
"h": "a17a86e9",
"en_raw": "Yes, there was such a time"
},
{
"n": 114,
"h": "7c4b13cb",
"en_raw": "It was soon after I came to Earth..."
},
{
"n": 115,
"h": "6c2fd4f2",
"en_raw": "Oh, oh, but now..."
},
{
"n": 116,
"h": "1f8be398",
"en_raw": "Then you do have memories!"
},
{
"n": 117,
"h": "ecd61ba7",
"en_raw": "Hey, tell me about the old days"
},
{
"n": 118,
"h": "d8c1c0e5",
"en_raw": "Mm..."
},
{
"n": 119,
"h": "7fc68ff9",
"en_raw": "Well, no use standing here talking"
},
{
"n": 120,
"h": "d6b01286",
"en_raw": "sit over there"
},
{
"n": 121,
"h": "465f024c",
"en_raw": "Ah, I'll pass on that"
},
{
"n": 122,
"h": "dd06a6da",
"en_raw": "Kapras people have short lifespans"
},
{
"n": 123,
"h": "b4ccd870",
"en_raw": "After my parents died"
},
{
"n": 124,
"h": "4d89bafc",
"en_raw": "on this remote planet"
},
{
"n": 125,
"h": "fa6508d2",
"en_raw": "I entered school"
},
{
"n": 126,
"h": "f5fbfd0e",
"en_raw": "as a scholarship student..."
},
{
"n": 127,
"h": "80bdc682",
"en_raw": "My major was economics"
},
{
"n": 128,
"h": "1777695c",
"en_raw": "but I wanted to know everything about Earth"
},
{
"n": 129,
"h": "3771d547",
"en_raw": "I studied like I was gnawing at it"
},
{
"n": 130,
"h": "a87dc653",
"en_raw": "I was diligent..."
},
{
"n": 131,
"h": "98ae1eb2",
"en_raw": "No, Kapras people are"
},
{
"n": 132,
"h": "46bb1e58",
"en_raw": "not diligent by nature"
},
{
"n": 133,
"h": "9082a9a2",
"en_raw": "Only what they want to do"
},
{
"n": 134,
"h": "e29f0eec",
"en_raw": "on others"
},
{
"n": 135,
"h": "57359809",
"en_raw": "My brain is built differently from Earthlings"
},
{
"n": 136,
"h": "dca7252c",
"en_raw": "How can I put it,"
},
{
"n": 137,
"h": "57c29c0f",
"en_raw": "my brain is all right brain"
},
{
"n": 138,
"h": "bb0cc235",
"en_raw": "that is, a sensory brain"
},
{
"n": 139,
"h": "40208dea",
"en_raw": "To be more detailed,"
},
{
"n": 140,
"h": "416e3b8e",
"en_raw": "in the basal ganglia..."
},
{
"n": 141,
"h": "15cef0c2",
"en_raw": "Ah, sorry, I digressed"
},
{
"n": 142,
"h": "c2e66649",
"en_raw": "Anyway, I liked"
},
{
"n": 143,
"h": "415e3e36",
"en_raw": "gaining knowledge"
},
{
"n": 144,
"h": "f558478f",
"en_raw": "It was around then"
},
{
"n": 145,
"h": "9654c86e",
"en_raw": "I learned how wonderful Earthlings are"
},
{
"n": 146,
"h": "51d556bf",
"en_raw": "And to fulfill the great purpose"
},
{
"n": 147,
"h": "9dc7afdf",
"en_raw": "of protecting Earth,"
},
{
"n": 148,
"h": "7ef3e193",
"en_raw": "what methods are there?"
},
{
"n": 149,
"h": "77e7efc6",
"en_raw": "At that time I set my eyes"
},
{
"n": 150,
"h": "7c8f6274",
"en_raw": "on a certain medium"
},
{
"n": 151,
"h": "38764382",
"en_raw": "Space waves, so-called satellite communication"
},
{
"n": 152,
"h": "3cb3056e",
"en_raw": "...Twenty years ago now?"
},
{
"n": 153,
"h": "095e48cb",
"en_raw": "Satellite TV from that long ago?"
},
{
"n": 154,
"h": "5e235de5",
"en_raw": "...Wow"
},
{
"n": 155,
"h": "32908b4a",
"en_raw": "But there I met my greatest enemy,"
},
{
"n": 156,
"h": "30e1e396",
"en_raw": "the Kinkodals"
},
{
"n": 157,
"h": "802c981e",
"en_raw": "I may tell you someday,"
},
{
"n": 158,
"h": "1d7be46e",
"en_raw": "but they're the worst in the galaxy"
},
{
"n": 159,
"h": "e58b9afb",
"en_raw": "And so I"
},
{
"n": 160,
"h": "0b371720",
"en_raw": "was robbed of"
},
{
"n": 161,
"h": "80999710",
"en_raw": "the means to protect Earth"
},
{
"n": 162,
"h": "5e6fa780",
"en_raw": "Afterward too, as a mere"
},
{
"n": 163,
"h": "6bfdcc07",
"en_raw": "Kapras person"
},
{
"n": 164,
"h": "83550422",
"en_raw": "I tried to resist in small ways"
},
{
"n": 165,
"h": "795d9c3d",
"en_raw": "but oh, oh, now"
},
{
"n": 166,
"h": "b9ed35ab",
"en_raw": "I'm a space outcast..."
},
{
"n": 167,
"h": "6b88ad63",
"en_raw": "Hmm, somehow"
},
{
"n": 168,
"h": "c2ddb412",
"en_raw": "Sounds like a microcosm of modern society..."
},
{
"n": 169,
"h": "cdf0b729",
"en_raw": "Well, don't be so downcast"
},
{
"n": 170,
"h": "a70e1ec5",
"en_raw": "Now, go on"
},
{
"n": 171,
"h": "fe30a0fb",
"en_raw": "Oh right, watch out for TV"
},
{
"n": 172,
"h": "243fa9cd",
"en_raw": "Mister, sorry"
},
{
"n": 173,
"h": "4de51e70",
"en_raw": "I'm in a hurry"
},
{
"n": 174,
"h": "e3b74fb6",
"en_raw": "if I don't hurry, the rescue ship..."
},
{
"n": 175,
"h": "180e83d7",
"en_raw": "Now, Earth girl"
},
{
"n": 176,
"h": "f89fdd83",
"en_raw": "How's Princess Bon's preparation?"
},
{
"n": 177,
"h": "982d21b7",
"en_raw": "Hey, mister"
},
{
"n": 178,
"h": "e3b74fb6",
"en_raw": "if I don't hurry, the rescue ship..."
},
{
"n": 179,
"h": "180e83d7",
"en_raw": "Now, Earth girl"
},
{
"n": 180,
"h": "f89fdd83",
"en_raw": "How's Princess Bon's preparation?"
},
{
"n": 181,
"h": "85dd60fb",
"en_raw": "I'm not Princess Bon"
},
{
"n": 182,
"h": "505f22f0",
"en_raw": "Shiina family's eldest daughter,"
},
{
"n": 183,
"h": "5593ce68",
"en_raw": "Kurumi Shiina, that's my real name"
},
{
"n": 184,
"h": "7ededef6",
"en_raw": "Mister, please, understand"
},
{
"n": 185,
"h": "d519b151",
"en_raw": "So you really are"
},
{
"n": 186,
"h": "4fcf8388",
"en_raw": "a Kinkodal!?"
},
{
"n": 187,
"h": "4ec5d7f9",
"en_raw": "Um"
},
{
"n": 188,
"h": "e3c6d247",
"en_raw": "I'm freezing already, enough"
},
{
"n": 189,
"h": "e04f0dea",
"en_raw": "Oh, oh, how terrible..."
},
{
"n": 190,
"h": "3348d72c",
"en_raw": "Once again the truth"
},
{
"n": 191,
"h": "c91c676a",
"en_raw": "is being hidden..."
},
{
"n": 192,
"h": "7f496c8f",
"en_raw": "...This is going nowhere"
},
{
"n": 193,
"h": "3769dd95",
"en_raw": "How terrible..."
},
{
"n": 194,
"h": "a2c752af",
"en_raw": "Another truth, a ray of hope"
},
{
"n": 195,
"h": "067e9ce0",
"en_raw": "swallowed by a sea of darkness..."
},
{
"n": 196,
"h": "80036c06",
"en_raw": "Huh...?"
},
{
"n": 197,
"h": "2160ffd2",
"en_raw": "He's gone..."
}
]
}